                <mxCell id="legend"
                        value="Legend:&#xa;- solid arrow = loads / references&#xa;- pastel groups (yellow / purple / blue / green) = the stack, layers 1-4; all feed the shared agents.md catalog&#xa;- orange group = opencode harness (sole active); cross-model split - glm-5.2 plans/reviews, MiniMax-M3 orchestrates/implements&#xa;- grey group = seven custom opencode agents + homelab MCP - the runtime that executes the stack&#xa;- white chips with no container = usage examples (how the stack is invoked by task size)&#xa;&#xa;Claude Code is supported-but-unused (CLAUDE.md shim + ~/.claude/ sync paths in the catalogs), not in daily use. The opencode-see-image plugin routes image attachments from the text-only GLM primary to MiniMax-M3.&#xa;&#xa;House rules: AGENTS.md = source of truth; CLAUDE.md = one-line shim; specs / plans / reviews in docs/artifacts/; no em-dashes; ISO 8601 dates; Conventional Commits. Snapshot 2026-07-31."
                        style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=9;align=left;verticalAlign=top"
